<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The Actor module is part of the LCAnet ontology proposed by the SmartACV Carnot Project. \n            It provides a formal representation of actors (e.g., persons, organizations, and groups) \n            involved in LCA processes, as well as their roles and responsibilities. \n            It resuses some elements from the FOAF (Friend Of A Freind) ontology." .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-05-20"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
