<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "The Actor module of the Life Cycle Assessment Network Ontology (LCAnet)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "actor" .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#" .
