<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Consumer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "epresents a type of role that an agent may assume when using or consuming a product or service during its life cycle." .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Consumer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Consumer" .
# 
