<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Context> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Responsibility> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Context> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Role> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Context> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A social, institutional, or processual situation that provides the setting in which a Role is played by an Agent and where its associated Responsibilities apply. Examples include projects, collaborations, assessments, or audits." .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Context> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Context" .
# 
