<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Customer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents a type of role that an agent may assume when acquiring or purchasing a product or service within its life cycle." .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Customer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Customer" .
# 
