<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Recycler> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Role> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Recycler> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents a type of role that an agent may assume when performing recovery, recycling, or treatment operations on products or materials at the end-of-life stage." .
