<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Researcher> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents a type of role that an agent may assume when conducting analysis, modeling, or scientific studies related to life cycle assessment data, methods, or systems." .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Researcher> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Researcher" .
