# https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Responsibility
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Responsibility> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Responsibility> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Role> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Responsibility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Responsibility is a relator (a kind of social relation) that connects: the Agent (bearer),\nthe Role (through which it is borne), and the Action(s) or Goals to which it applies. It include duties, obligations, tasks, etc.\nExamples: certify LCA results, verify data quality, etc." .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Responsibility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Responsibility" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Role
