<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents a functional role that an agent can assume in a specific context.\nExample: LCA Auditor, LCA Agency Role" .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Role" .
